# Canonical Domain Enforcement
# NOTE (P0-3 fix): Cloudflare Pages `_redirects` only accepts RELATIVE paths as
# the redirect source, so absolute-URL rules (e.g.
# "https://height-calculator.pages.dev/* -> https://height-calculator.net/:splat")
# were silently ignored and have been removed. The pages.dev -> apex 301
# (path-preserving) is now implemented in functions/_middleware.js, which
# genuinely emits a 301. The http:// and www rules below were equally invalid
# and are intentionally not re-added here (www DNS is a separate P1 issue).

